Thu Sep  9 22:30:18 UTC 2021 - Alexei Podvalsky <avvissu@yandex.by>

- Update to 0.1.22:
  * Fixed flatpak issue where dragging an image gives a 0 byte
    sized image and would therefore not be optimized. Also fixed
    issue where optimizing an image from the home directory would not
    work.
  * Updated flatpak runtime to version 6
  * Fixed issue where the close and maximise buttons were shown
    in white
  * Updated screenshots
  * Getting things ready for Elementary OS 6.
  * Added the flatpak manifest file for elementary os 6. Also
    fixes vala 0.48 build issue.

